   Known fix: add to step 3 (before the red run) a unit-level substep that gives `PublishTests` its own tag that matches the `widget` component (for example `PUBLISH_TAG = "widget-v1.0.0"`, used by `_publish` and the four URL assertions), leaves `TAG` for `FileUrlTests`, and lets `_publish` accept a `tag` override (`kwargs.setdefault("tag", PUBLISH_TAG)`) so the `Notes {version}` test can use `widget-v1.0.2`. Say that the existing publish tests are expected to stay green after this change and are run before the new red tests are added.

